{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05730","headline":"广武怀古 · 杨浚","name":"广武怀古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"河水城下流，登城望弥惬。\n海云飞不断，岸草绿相接。\n龙门无旧塲，武牢有遗堞。\n扼喉兵易守，扪指计何捷。\n天夺项氏谋，卒成汉家业。\n乡山遥可见，西顾泪盈睫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨浚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05730.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05730","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}